{"seq":2,"slug":"module-system","title":"模块系统","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modules-signatures-functors","title":"模块、签名与函子","url":"/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/modules-signatures-functors","wordCount":1201,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-class-modules","title":"一等公民模块","url":"/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/first-class-modules","wordCount":1309,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"abstraction-encapsulation","title":"抽象与封装模式","url":"/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/abstraction-encapsulation","wordCount":1254,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 模块系统\n\nOCaml 的模块系统是这门语言最具辨识度的设计——它是目前工业语言中最强大的模块化抽象机制之一。从基本的模块与签名到参数化的函子（Functor），从一等公民模块到 OCaml 5.5 引入的模块依赖函数，模块系统提供了在大规模代码库中组织、封装和复用代码的完整工具箱。\n\n本章三篇文档沿着抽象层次递进：基础模块与签名与函子的机制、一等模块的动态能力、以及基于模块的封装与抽象设计模式。Jane Street 数千万行 OCaml 代码的可维护性，很大程度上得益于对模块系统的深度运用。\n"}